Subject : [IMPORTANT] Customer issues on IAS
TO : ASI, WSI
CC : ASG, WSG
FM : CCE

 Thank you for your cooperation.

 We know that all of you are very busy and having hard time to give your feedback for current bidding rate inquiry and other big customer's issue on time.
 By the way, CCE found that some of important customer issues such as the bidding of Philips / rate idea & strategy for DHL have been proceeded without any discussion with CCE-IAS.
 We assume these kind of issues may be the case initial mail was sent not copied CCE-IAS.
 But, before you reply all IAS issues, the discussion with all related CCE-IAS members are definitely required.
 Also, before you send any minor reply to other parties, please be reminded you have to check if CCE-IAS is copied in that mail.
 CCE managing overall IAS customers & profitability issue on all IAS lanes will anticipate your immediate update for all IAS issues with CCE-IAS all the time.

B.RGDS,


